The issue is not valid as In my code I&apos;m missing the call to start the SjmsComponent. Since the CamelContext is already started it doesn&apos;t start the SjmsComponent automatically and that is the root cause of the error. So the problem is fixed by adding the call to start() method on SjmsComponent:
